    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741400/extras/520f0dcd3e77802ed8779a59a56fca49.poster.avif?t=1718294985\" width=610 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741400/extras/520f0dcd3e77802ed8779a59a56fca49.webm?t=1718294985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Drop Racing</strong> is a game where the fastest player to drop all the pieces of the track wins!<br><br><strong>ABOUT THE GAME</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Face other teams in equal piece sequences (that one master, like a motorsport track)<br></li><li>The speed mechanic (the piece\u2019s spawn and fall times vary according to how fast the player is playing)<br></li><li>Easy to pick, understand and play, for short or long play sessions<br></li><li>Made with a lot of care and attention to every detail<br></li><li>No grinding; all tracks and team options are available from the start<br></li><li>Familiar gameplay, but with different ways of playing and multiple game strategies</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741400/extras/4103194bf4ab38ce898eb89e5fc753de.poster.avif?t=1718294985\" width=610 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741400/extras/4103194bf4ab38ce898eb89e5fc753de.webm?t=1718294985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741400/extras/25c0197333595a9a0bd15b05c85ebca9.avif?t=1718294985\" width=610 height=160 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741400/extras/520f0dcd3e77802ed8779a59a56fca49.poster.avif?t=1718294985\" width=610 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741400/extras/520f0dcd3e77802ed8779a59a56fca49.webm?t=1718294985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Drop Racing</strong> is a game where the fastest player to drop all the pieces of the track wins!<br><br><strong>ABOUT THE GAME</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Face other teams in equal piece sequences (that one master, like a motorsport track)<br></li><li>The speed mechanic (the piece\u2019s spawn and fall times vary according to how fast the player is playing)<br></li><li>Easy to pick, understand and play, for short or long play sessions<br></li><li>Made with a lot of care and attention to every detail<br></li><li>No grinding; all tracks and team options are available from the start<br></li><li>Familiar gameplay, but with different ways of playing and multiple game strategies</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741400/extras/4103194bf4ab38ce898eb89e5fc753de.poster.avif?t=1718294985\" width=610 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741400/extras/4103194bf4ab38ce898eb89e5fc753de.webm?t=1718294985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741400/extras/25c0197333595a9a0bd15b05c85ebca9.avif?t=1718294985\" width=610 height=160 /></span>",
